# The collected market database. Never committed.
#
# Twelve Data's terms license the data for "Internal Use ... not for
# redistribution", and define redistribution as "any publication, distribution,
# or provision of Data to third parties". Committing these files to a public
# repository would be exactly that. The repository holds the collector instead,
# so anyone with their own free key can rebuild an identical database.
data/db/
data/raw/


# The model response cache is large and goes to Hugging Face, not git.
.cache/
cache/

